(7465538, 1184448, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by PennyStreet:</b></div><hr/><i> I love the foreground as much as the faces. I think you''ve acquired some excellent new gear! Congrats on the high placement... this was my only 8. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. Hmm possibly took this with my new 100mm macro Canon lens. Usually my photos display the lens info - not sure why not this time. Perhaps I saved for web and it removed all the info. I will check and update next time I am on the desktop PC</td>', 'Originally posted by PennyStreet: I love the foreground as much as the faces. I think you''ve acquired some excellent new gear! Congrats on the high placement... this was my only 8.   Thank you. Hmm possibly took this with my new 100mm macro Canon lens. Usually my photos display the lens info - not sure why not this time. Perhaps I saved for web and it removed all the info. I will check and update next time I am on the desktop PC', '2016-07-23 13:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
