(7466242, 1184534, 53814, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> oh pointy. growing little cabbages under plastic this year? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Mom always did say you were the psychic one, Sister T. This is the exact same location, sans the kaleheads.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: oh pointy. growing little cabbages under plastic this year?   Mom always did say you were the psychic one, Sister T. This is the exact same location, sans the kaleheads.', '2016-07-28 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 0),
